OL,3,GNEWSAMum warns drivers after son killed
OL,4,Aby loose plank
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of an 11-year-old boy who
OL,7,Fdied after being struck by an object
OL,8,Fwhich fell from a van has said she is
OL,9,Ffighting to cut road deaths because she
OL,10,Fdoes not want to become "bitter and
OL,11,Ftwisted".
OL,13,FHarry Dennis died in hospital after
OL,14,Fbeing struck by a loose plank as he sat
OL,15,Fin the front seat of his father's car
OL,16,Fin Hooe, East Sussex, in December 2022.
OL,18,FThe van driver, Russell Le Beau, from
OL,19,FEastbourne, admitted causing death by
OL,20,Fdangerous driving and was jailed for
OL,21,Ffour years at Lewes Crown Court.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
